  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f69c6b1f1e1fc2c4b9a85c7696ada520, type: 3}
  m_Name: AfterHarbor3
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogSO
  replics:
  - "Eve! Perfect timing. I\u2019m checking and packing the gear right now\u2026
    I\u2019m so stressed I keep dropping everything. "
  - "You have no idea\u2026 Cyber connected me with my grandmother. With my family.
    Grandma\u2019s alive. "
  - "Let me help with the equipment. And your grandmother\u2026 where does she live?
    Where are we even going?"
  - "Ooooh\u2026 Grandma lives in beautiful Puertollano! Not rich, but peaceful"
  - "Wait a second\u2026 are we living at your grandmother\u2019s house?"
  - "WITH THE GRANDMOTHER? Ahem\u2026 I mean\u2026 honestly, I\u2019m scared of grandmas.
    They\u2019re creepy."
  - "That\u2019s\u2026 an unusual reaction. But living with someone\u2019s grandma
    is awkward."
  - "Oh come on, enough already\u2026 We don\u2019t have to stay there forever. My
    parents are in Madrid. But we\u2019ll have to crash at Grandma\u2019s place for
    a while."
  - Eve, are you seriously afraid of grandmas?
  - "Ahem. More like elderly people. Especially elderly people with implants. After
    the tests on Cyber, my grandmother got the same eye implants\u2026"
  - "And she loved drinking tea at night while reading in complete darkness. One
    time\u2026 half asleep, I opened the wrong door\u2026 "
  - "And she was sitting in the corner of the room in the dark\u2026 with those glowing
    red eyes. Nearly scared me to death."
  - "I should reassure you that only a very small percentage of Spanish grandmothers
    have implants, and mostly for medical reasons. Good lord\u2026"
  - "That\u2019s horrifying\u2026 And I used to regret not being born into a corporate
    family. But wait\u2026 you and Cyber ran away at sixteen, right? When did they
    do that to his eye?"
  - "Oh, Cyber\u2019s had implants for a long time. The first ones were installed
    when he was around five. Since his body was still growing, he constantly had
    headaches."
  - "He cried a lot. Every time the pain came back, they had to operate again. Honestly,
    I sometimes wonder if that\u2019s why he\u2019s so angry all the time\u2026 Maybe
    they messed something up in his head."
  - "Though I had eye surgeries too\u2026 and body surgeries\u2026 God, I remember
    how much my bones hurt."
  - "Jesus\u2026 but unlike Cyber, you don\u2019t really look mechanical. Aside from
    the gold tattoos."
  - "Most of my surgeries were on my bones. One advantage is\u2026 I have fewer ribs
    and more vertebrae now. Makes my limbs bend in unnatural directions."
  - "Originally it was all meant to prepare my body for weapon implants later on\u2026
    but the project was still in development."
  - "After all this, the first thing we\u2019re doing is taking you for a medical
    examination\u2026 How can people treat children like this\u2026 "
  - "Hm? But I\u2019m healthy. Nothing\u2019s broken yet."
  - 'I think Beast meant a psychiatrist. '
  - "HEY! You could use one too, actually. Alright, enough. Distribute the ammo,
    I\u2019m going to check on Asahi."
  - "Oh\u2026 well, God help us. "
  - "I don\u2019t believe in Him. And neither should you."
